  objectSprite: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 2e42df4c082067d44ab56fab0169d0a6, type: 3}
  questDescription: Farmer Greta here. This plow should do a whole field with the
    least effort, the best it can be, legendary! It must be properly sturdy on stones
    and keep my oxen decently safe. Maybe a tiny bit lucky, too.
  requirements:
  - type: 1
    tier: 2
  - type: 4
    tier: 3
  - type: 5
    tier: 1
  - type: 6
    tier: 2
  successText: The whole field in one morning! Sturdy, safe, and I found a coin!
    Wonderful!
  partialText: The field is plowed. Slowly. Well, it will do.
  failureText: Now the oxen are sulking and the field is a mess! Out!
